WARNING:DEVICE_ATTR_FUNCTIONS: Consider renaming function(s) 'show_str_bootcount' to 'bootcount_show' 'store_str_bootcount' to 'bootcount_store'
#259: FILE: drivers/char/bootcount.c:135:
